{
  "provenance": {
    "source": "heygen-com/experiment-framework origin/master 48f3e075e0e: openapi/external-api.json /v3/video-generations (EF #55517 Seedance 2.5, #55595 H3 Max, #55674, #55759, #55779)",
    "checked_at": "2026-10-08",
    "kind": "backend-OpenAPI-derived structural contract; route hidden from public docs",
    "notes": [
      "Asynchronous: POST answers 200 with status pending; GET /v3/video-generations/{id} until completed (time-limited video_url) or failed.",
      "Idempotency-Key is required; the same key and body returns the original generation.",
      "Auth: x-api-key only (OAuth refused, EF #55674); charged to HeyGen API credits at the vendor list price; 402 insufficient_credit before any vendor call; a failed generation is refunded.",
      "minimax-h3-max (fal minimax/h3-max/reference-to-video): first_frame, end_frame and middle_frame are exact frames and combine with reference images, videos and audio. Enterprise workspaces need minimax on their vendor allow list (403 otherwise).",
      "seedance-2.5 has no frame fields: a frame passed as a reference image guides the look but is not the literal first frame. It may refuse real people.",
      "2026-10-08: deployed on the api-service canary; prod answers 404 until the release reaches it.",
      "Request body at most about 22 MiB; inline base64 references together under about 16 MiB decoded."
    ]
  },
